  "description": "The SUPREME DH V5 RIDE is built with high-performance SRAM components.\n• A ROCKSHOX BoXXer Base fork is proven to be reliable. Equipped with the DebonAir + air spring and a Charger 3 RC cartridge, it offers simple and precise rebound and low-speed compression adjustments. The ROCKSHOX Vivid Coil Base shock combines impeccable sensitivity and excellent mid-stroke support thanks to its coil spring.\n• TRP DH-R EVO PRO brakes are matched to the new discs with improved bite and heat dissipation. They are progressive, consistent, and easy to use.\n• DT SWISS wheels with F1900 Classic rims and hubs provide dynamism and reliability.\n• The SRAM GX DH drivetrain has precise 7-speed shifting and is ideal for downhill riding.",
